# The context of web/Dockerfile.dev. Installed dependencies and builds come from inside the image,
# never from the host: a host's node_modules holds another platform's binaries.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# The client's generated types: the dev server needs none of them (ADR-161).
packages/api-client/src/generated/
# The phone app stays outside the pnpm workspace (ADR-039) and out of the web image.
mobile/
.env*
# A .env file anywhere in the build context, not only at its root, never enters an image
**/.env*
**/*.env
